                            "A male given name transferred from the surname, of rare usage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7539d5e5-dc54-33fc-b6de-e6d01160e6fe",
                        "entry_id": "302ef324-835c-3c87-b773-127d9764ba7b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A detective (from Sherlock Holmes), especially used sarcastically to address somebody who has stated the obvious."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "humorous"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3533fcd2-eb8d-461e-bb9a-49a7e8fff4c4",
                                "sense_id": "7539d5e5-dc54-33fc-b6de-e6d01160e6fe",
                                "text": "— Where that arrow on the map says 'You are here', that must be where we are.\n— Yeah, well done Sherlock."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "e35a14a5-fa87-3346-81e7-31612d484c6f",
                "word": "Sherlock",
